    Bug 1968470 - Add 'Copy Message Link' and 'Copy News Link' to header pane's 'More actions'. r=aleca,mkmelin


    This puts the 'mid:' URI or the exact 'news:' URL of the displayed message on
    the clipboard. Also add these actions to the 'Organize' submenu of the mail
    context menu.

    Introduce the MailUtils.constructNewsUriSpec() function, which is also used to
    create a URI that identifies a newsgroup.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D254401

